{"id":"mental","lemma":"mental","pos":"adj","rank":1791,"glosses":["mental"],"ipa":"/menˈtal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"mentales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mental.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tienen un buen cacao mental.","en":"They're insane.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441230"},{"text":"¿Tom tiene problemas mentales?","en":"Does Tom have mental problems?"},{"text":"Estaba cansado mental y físicamente.","en":"I was mentally and physically tired.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505869"},{"text":"Los problemas del chico son físicos, no mentales.","en":"The boy's problems are physical, not mental."},{"text":"Necesito un poco de estímulo mental.","en":"I need some mental stimulation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77341"}]}